{
  "_readme": "Edit this file to add stroke images and notes. Each item: { id, label, notes: {en, id}, forms: [...] }. forms: each is { pos, img }. pos is 'normal' (the base/non-positional way to write it -- shown bigger when it appears alongside 3 or more forms in the same row, e.g. next to initial/medial/final), 'initial', 'medial', 'final', or '' (no named position at all -- shown as Form 1, Form 2, ... with no size boost). Repeat the same pos twice (e.g. two 'initial' entries) for alternate ways to write that position -- they'll be auto-numbered 'Initial 1' / 'Initial 2'. img is a relative path to a png/svg/jpg file, e.g. 'assets/img/stroke/a-initial.svg'. Leave img empty ('') for slots you haven't drawn yet -- shows a placeholder box instead. notes.en / notes.id is a short line shown under the card (how to form the stroke, a memory tip, etc.) -- leave both empty to hide the notes line entirely. Add a whole new group (e.g. more digraphs, more markers) by copying a group object and changing its id/label/items.",
